# Simulation-harness database — isolated from BOTH the dev DB
# (`prosper_hotel`) and the test-suite DB (`prosper_hotel_tests`).
#
# The long-horizon simulator (tests/simulation/) drives 60+ business days
# of real API calls against a single, single-threaded timeline. It needs a
# database nothing else writes to: the test pool's 8 schemas are wiped and
# reseeded by `pretest`, and parallel suites write into them mid-run.
#
# Committed on purpose: local connection string only, no secrets.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://prosper:prosper@localhost:5432/prosper_hotel_sim?schema=public&connection_limit=10&pool_timeout=20"
NEXTAUTH_URL="http://localhost:3000"
NEXTAUTH_SECRET="simulation-only-secret-not-used-for-anything-real"
